{"ep": "18", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:02.83", "end": "0:00:03.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "奇怪"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:06.41", "end": "0:00:07.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "奇怪"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:09.23", "end": "0:00:09.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "奇怪"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:11.59", "end": "0:00:15.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么东西怪怪的  我不知为啥有这种感觉"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:15.81", "end": "0:00:20.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视中正在播放的  是跟我一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:20.72", "end": "0:00:23.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥我正支持着正处于落后的一方"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:24.14", "end": "0:00:28.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后又不知为啥觉得差不多春日要搞点事出来了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:37.44", "end": "0:00:39.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  电话"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:39.58", "end": "0:00:41.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用你说我也知道"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:46.53", "end": "0:00:47.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:47.94", "end": "0:00:51.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合  老老实实地过来哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:53.52", "end": "0:00:55.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我连一句话都没说上"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:58.80", "end": "0:00:59.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 13, "start": "0:01:00.09", "end": "0:01:01.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说带东西来了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 14, "start": "0:01:02.28", "end": "0:01:05.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一套泳装  还有足够的钱"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:05.85", "end": "0:01:09.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后一定要骑自行车来  Over～"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:09.79", "end": "0:01:10.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都说了我连一句话都没说上了…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:13.91", "end": "0:01:17.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好像又知道春日打算要说啥"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:18.29", "end": "0:01:19.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不对"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:19.58", "end": "0:01:23.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说  是感觉之前好像出现过完全相同的事情"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 20, "start": "0:01:23.70", "end": "0:01:25.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是所谓的「既视感」么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 21, "start": "0:01:42.02", "end": "0:01:43.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天就这样缴枪了啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 22, "start": "0:03:15.64", "end": "0:03:16.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 23, "start": "0:03:17.05", "end": "0:03:18.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多拿点干劲出来！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 24, "start": "0:03:19.03", "end": "0:03:20.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 25, "start": "0:03:21.63", "end": "0:03:23.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让你们久等真抱歉"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:23.52", "end": "0:03:25.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也才刚到"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:26.00", "end": "0:03:29.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:29.34", "end": "0:03:29.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去哪里？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:30.98", "end": "0:03:33.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:33.76", "end": "0:03:36.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从这准备的架势来看也是吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:36.29", "end": "0:03:39.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天当然要有夏天的样子  要做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:40.04", "end": "0:03:43.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:43.91", "end": "0:03:45.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:45.36", "end": "0:03:48.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:50.14", "end": "0:03:52.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便我们是骑自行车去泳池"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:52.90", "end": "0:03:54.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们也骑来了么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:55.17", "end": "0:03:58.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  自行车只有你和我的两辆"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:58.90", "end": "0:03:59.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 39, "start": "0:04:00.72", "end": "0:04:03.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听好了  阿虚  可不能输给古泉哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 40, "start": "0:04:03.99", "end": "0:04:05.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  立即出发"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 41, "start": "0:04:10.58", "end": "0:04:13.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂喂  你们两个赶紧停好车"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:15.57", "end": "0:04:19.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说阿虚  接下来是要玩啊  你怎么就筋疲力尽了？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:19.56", "end": "0:04:21.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是谁的错啊  谁的啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:22.03", "end": "0:04:26.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这消毒液的气味  真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:26.74", "end": "0:04:28.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  来游泳吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:28.82", "end": "0:04:30.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比赛哦比赛"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:31.29", "end": "0:04:32.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学  等等"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:34.73", "end": "0:04:35.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "挺欢乐的嘛"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:36.47", "end": "0:04:37.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:38.05", "end": "0:04:42.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是很欢乐的情景  还真让人感到和平呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:42.57", "end": "0:04:47.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得  凉宫同学也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:48.22", "end": "0:04:53.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然打个电话过来  单方面地说有事就挂的邀请方式"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:53.49", "end": "0:04:55.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实在不能说得上是常识性的吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:56.23", "end": "0:05:00.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就那点事  要我说根本不算什么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:00.64", "end": "0:05:03.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笑得那么开心的凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:03.87", "end": "0:05:06.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:07.08", "end": "0:05:08.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真是那样就好了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:11.05", "end": "0:05:11.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:12.36", "end": "0:05:13.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没什么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:15.29", "end": "0:05:17.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概是我的错觉吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:17.90", "end": "0:05:19.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概是因为从初春开始就发生了太多事情"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:19.79", "end": "0:05:22.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "变得有点神经质了吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:26.43", "end": "0:05:27.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  又输了啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:28.31", "end": "0:05:30.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希  我们再比一次"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:40.30", "end": "0:05:41.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好吃"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:48.52", "end": "0:05:54.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  与其说是市民泳池  倒是个更适合平民泳池这名字的地方"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:54.50", "end": "0:05:57.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么春日会选这样一个地方来啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:58.92", "end": "0:05:59.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:59.66", "end": "0:06:05.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  与其说是市民泳池  倒是个更适合平民泳池这名字的地方"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 70, "start": "0:06:05.73", "end": "0:06:08.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么春日会选这样一个地方来啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 71, "start": "0:06:09.97", "end": "0:06:10.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 72, "start": "0:06:11.12", "end": "0:06:11.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:12.47", "end": "0:06:14.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种感觉是什么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:18.10", "end": "0:06:21.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  然后春日说了这种话"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:21.67", "end": "0:06:23.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个就是我的团员"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:23.92", "end": "0:06:26.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说什么他们都会听的  所以随便吩咐吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:27.60", "end": "0:06:28.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  要玩了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:29.05", "end": "0:06:30.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来玩水中足球吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:32.44", "end": "0:06:33.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是是"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:34.37", "end": "0:06:35.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  这种事也常有"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:36.13", "end": "0:06:36.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既视感什么的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:39.46", "end": "0:06:40.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是啥"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:41.35", "end": "0:06:44.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "剩余不多的暑假该如何度过的预定表啦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:45.37", "end": "0:06:50.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然发现  暑假只剩下两个星期了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:50.98", "end": "0:06:52.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后要赶快地去玩啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:53.90", "end": "0:06:55.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要在不到两周内搞完这个…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:56.12", "end": "0:06:58.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠有什么想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:59.97", "end": "0:07:05.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…我想捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 89, "start": "0:07:05.48", "end": "0:07:06.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 90, "start": "0:07:07.92", "end": "0:07:10.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捞…金…鱼…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 91, "start": "0:07:11.05", "end": "0:07:11.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:12.43", "end": "0:07:14.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思  我看下"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:14.45", "end": "0:07:15.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  嗯"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:17.08", "end": "0:07:17.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:18.12", "end": "0:07:18.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以了吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:19.07", "end": "0:07:19.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:20.00", "end": "0:07:21.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:22.63", "end": "0:07:25.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这附近什么地方有盂兰盆会么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:25.60", "end": "0:07:27.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有烟花汇演也可以"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:27.78", "end": "0:07:29.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查一下吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:29.57", "end": "0:07:31.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别忘了捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:31.52", "end": "0:07:32.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:39.95", "end": "0:07:41.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是我给钱吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:42.02", "end": "0:07:43.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  今天就此解散"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:44.70", "end": "0:07:45.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我也回去了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:46.86", "end": "0:07:47.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:55.92", "end": "0:07:56.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:59.90", "end": "0:08:02.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  其实也没有什么事"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 109, "start": "0:08:03.62", "end": "0:08:06.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近如何  精神好么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:06.65", "end": "0:08:07.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:07.82", "end": "0:08:08.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那太好了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:10.10", "end": "0:08:10.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:13.48", "end": "0:08:18.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "打…打搅你了  抱歉"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:19.80", "end": "0:08:23.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  为什么我会去和长门搭腔呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:28.23", "end": "0:08:33.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天早晨  将我的懒觉夺走的又是春日的电话"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:34.13", "end": "0:08:35.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "似乎是说找到盂兰盆会的会场了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:36.06", "end": "0:08:38.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今晚  地点似乎是市民运动场"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:39.76", "end": "0:08:43.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  今天你又是最后一个  真是的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:44.39", "end": "0:08:48.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是算了  我们大伙一起去买浴衣吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:50.59", "end": "0:08:52.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日进了女装的大卖场之后"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:53.29", "end": "0:08:55.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "擅自为朝比奈学姐和长门挑选了浴衣"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:55.91", "end": "0:08:58.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后毫不客气地冲进了试衣间"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:59.30", "end": "0:09:01.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后我们等了大约一小时"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 124, "start": "0:09:02.20", "end": "0:09:03.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三个人终于出来了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 125, "start": "0:09:04.27", "end": "0:09:05.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎样怎样"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 126, "start": "0:09:06.19", "end": "0:09:06.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:07.40", "end": "0:09:08.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很不错吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:09.66", "end": "0:09:11.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位都非常合适哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:11.55", "end": "0:09:14.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然啦  是我给挑选的嘛"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:14.63", "end": "0:09:16.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "特别是实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:16.78", "end": "0:09:21.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好可爱  太可爱了  真不愧是我挑的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:22.07", "end": "0:09:22.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:23.10", "end": "0:09:25.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐  转过来！转过来！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:26.66", "end": "0:09:29.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  好厉害啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:30.21", "end": "0:09:32.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这么热闹真好"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:32.90", "end": "0:09:38.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "盂兰盆会啊  真亏得能聚集起这么多人…啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:40.86", "end": "0:09:44.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了  怎么又是这种感觉呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:45.99", "end": "0:09:46.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:47.19", "end": "0:09:49.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那边有你想要玩的捞金鱼哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:50.37", "end": "0:09:51.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去捞个痛快吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:52.23", "end": "0:09:53.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:53.27", "end": "0:09:56.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去玩吧  来一决高下如何"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:57.16", "end": "0:09:57.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:58.76", "end": "0:09:59.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起这个来  长门"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 145, "start": "0:10:00.28", "end": "0:10:01.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要吃点什么吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:05.68", "end": "0:10:08.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  长门  你对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 147, "start": "0:10:09.63", "end": "0:10:10.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:10.25", "end": "0:10:10.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:15.12", "end": "0:10:15.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:15.62", "end": "0:10:17.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的  800日元"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:17.82", "end": "0:10:20.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知为啥有种受她照顾的感觉"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:20.70", "end": "0:10:22.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但那种程度的我来买就好了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:24.32", "end": "0:10:25.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "十三条"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:25.77", "end": "0:10:28.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我不需要那么多  就只要了一条"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:29.05", "end": "0:10:30.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那还真是厉害"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:31.42", "end": "0:10:33.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只吃一个的话没关系哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:33.89", "end": "0:10:34.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:38.08", "end": "0:10:40.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦  那面具哪里弄来的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:40.23", "end": "0:10:40.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:41.39", "end": "0:10:42.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  是么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:43.91", "end": "0:10:46.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  接下来玩烟花吧  烟花"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:46.53", "end": "0:10:48.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天就一起做了吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:50.43", "end": "0:10:52.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是夏天  在暑假中"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 164, "start": "0:10:53.34", "end": "0:10:55.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  虽然极力想要忘记"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 165, "start": "0:10:55.84", "end": "0:10:58.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但有件事情却让我很在意"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 166, "start": "0:10:59.82", "end": "0:11:02.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  明天是捉昆虫呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 167, "start": "0:11:02.74", "end": "0:11:06.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:07.72", "end": "0:11:12.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你说什么嘛  那种程度的作业有三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:12.63", "end": "0:11:13.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "Three days！？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:13.64", "end": "0:11:18.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾掉再玩到爽"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:19.05", "end": "0:11:21.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是正确的享受暑假的方法"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:22.82", "end": "0:11:25.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这种家伙脑子这么好"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:25.58", "end": "0:11:29.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上天对于人的参数调整还真是随便啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:30.03", "end": "0:11:32.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以  明天去捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:33.25", "end": "0:11:38.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捉到的虫子最多的那个人  怎么好呢…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:38.65", "end": "0:11:42.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  就把团长的权力让给他一天！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:42.45", "end": "0:11:42.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "才不要呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:43.44", "end": "0:11:46.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很有趣呢  只要是虫子的话什么都可以么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:47.58", "end": "0:11:51.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔…只能抓蝉"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:51.69", "end": "0:11:55.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  这就是SOS团内部的捉蝉大战！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 181, "start": "0:11:57.74", "end": "0:12:01.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  是个让人有种「连这也是啊」的感觉的大晴天"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:01.65", "end": "0:12:04.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团内部的捉蝉大战就在这大晴天下进行"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:05.48", "end": "0:12:09.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说大家都在努力奋斗  可应该说不出所料还是说啥呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:09.45", "end": "0:12:11.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "获胜者是春日"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:12.36", "end": "0:12:15.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说到底  还是要有放生的精神"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:16.14", "end": "0:12:20.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天放它们一条生路  以后说不定会来报恩呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:20.31", "end": "0:12:23.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "蝉来了到底能为我们做些啥啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:23.68", "end": "0:12:25.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  回山里去吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:30.83", "end": "0:12:34.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总觉得有点打开了盒子的潘多拉的感觉呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:35.18", "end": "0:12:37.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢…欢迎光临"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:37.30", "end": "0:12:41.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  我们在一无所知的情况下被套上了青蛙的罩衣"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:42.18", "end": "0:12:44.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开始在超市的门口兼职"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:47.09", "end": "0:12:48.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位辛苦了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:48.75", "end": "0:12:50.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这待遇差算啥啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:50.73", "end": "0:12:51.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "辛苦了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:51.93", "end": "0:12:54.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "店长大叔也谢谢大家了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:54.89", "end": "0:12:56.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要大叔的感谢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:57.14", "end": "0:12:57.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工钱呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 199, "start": "0:12:58.41", "end": "0:12:59.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个咯"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 200, "start": "0:13:00.27", "end": "0:13:00.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:01.21", "end": "0:13:04.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要这个了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:04.67", "end": "0:13:07.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大叔也看在实玖瑠的份上说送给我们的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:08.51", "end": "0:13:12.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们就为了这种东西累死累活地干活么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:12.71", "end": "0:13:14.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把这放在社团室做纪念吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:15.21", "end": "0:13:19.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:19.69", "end": "0:13:20.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:28.73", "end": "0:13:31.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那天晚上  夺去了我的安眠的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:31.71", "end": "0:13:33.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是一个电话"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:40.32", "end": "0:13:41.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂喂！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 210, "start": "0:13:41.68", "end": "0:13:42.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 211, "start": "0:13:43.15", "end": "0:13:43.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 212, "start": "0:13:44.17", "end": "0:13:45.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 213, "start": "0:13:47.19", "end": "0:13:48.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 214, "start": "0:13:48.91", "end": "0:13:51.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是  是我"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 215, "start": "0:13:51.60", "end": "0:13:57.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个  有非常不好的事情…这样下去我…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 216, "start": "0:13:58.14", "end": "0:13:59.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么办才好"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 217, "start": "0:14:00.41", "end": "0:14:00.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 218, "start": "0:14:01.09", "end": "0:14:02.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你好  我是古泉"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 219, "start": "0:14:03.18", "end": "0:14:05.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么会这个时候跟朝比奈学姐在一起"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 220, "start": "0:14:06.52", "end": "0:14:10.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为有点情况  你能现在就过来么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 221, "start": "0:14:11.36", "end": "0:14:12.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这混蛋  你这混蛋"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:15.35", "end": "0:14:17.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到底发生什么事了  朝比奈学姐？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:19.64", "end": "0:14:20.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:20.90", "end": "0:14:28.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回不了未来了…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:28.53", "end": "0:14:29.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我完全不明白"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:32.00", "end": "0:14:33.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  事情是这样的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:34.21", "end": "0:14:37.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们在永久地重复着同样的时间"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:38.24", "end": "0:14:41.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算你满面春光地把那种非现实的话说出来…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:42.24", "end": "0:14:45.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你知道自己在说什么吗  嗯？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:46.51", "end": "0:14:49.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "知道  相当清楚"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 231, "start": "0:14:51.15", "end": "0:14:53.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我刚才和朝比奈学姐谈了下"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 232, "start": "0:14:54.03", "end": "0:14:56.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是叫上我啊  然后你好回去了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 233, "start": "0:14:56.73", "end": "0:15:01.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后意识到最近这里时间的流动出现了异常"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 234, "start": "0:15:02.80", "end": "0:15:05.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这该说是朝比奈学姐的功绩吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 235, "start": "0:15:06.12", "end": "0:15:08.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "托她的福我也确信了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 236, "start": "0:15:08.83", "end": "0:15:10.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确信什么了？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 237, "start": "0:15:10.71", "end": "0:15:15.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们已经重复体验同样的时间许多次了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 238, "start": "0:15:15.86", "end": "0:15:17.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个刚才就听你说了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 239, "start": "0:15:17.54", "end": "0:15:21.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正确地说应该是八月十七日到三十一日之间"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 240, "start": "0:15:22.47", "end": "0:15:25.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们正处于一个没有尽头的暑假的正当中"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 241, "start": "0:15:26.37", "end": "0:15:28.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在确实是暑假…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 242, "start": "0:15:28.96", "end": "0:15:31.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "绝对无法结束的Endless Summer"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 243, "start": "0:15:32.24", "end": "0:15:37.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在这个世界里  九月一日之后的时间全部消失了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 244, "start": "0:15:38.82", "end": "0:15:40.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要谁相信那个啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 245, "start": "0:15:41.08", "end": "0:15:44.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我希望至少你能相信"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 246, "start": "0:15:45.73", "end": "0:15:50.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们被困在那个叫什么封锁空间里了吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 247, "start": "0:15:52.87", "end": "0:15:54.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 248, "start": "0:15:54.62", "end": "0:15:57.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是一部分的时间被分割开了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 249, "start": "0:15:58.24", "end": "0:16:01.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到八月三十一日二十四时整的那一瞬"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 250, "start": "0:16:02.13", "end": "0:16:06.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都被重置  再回到十七日的过程"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 251, "start": "0:16:07.32", "end": "0:16:08.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 252, "start": "0:16:08.26", "end": "0:16:10.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  全人类的记忆呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 253, "start": "0:16:10.21", "end": "0:16:14.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那些也会重置  会重头再来一次"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 254, "start": "0:16:16.96", "end": "0:16:19.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又是关于时间这个那个了的问题吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 255, "start": "0:16:19.98", "end": "0:16:23.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之…既然未来人也混进来了  那我觉得也没办法"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 256, "start": "0:16:24.20", "end": "0:16:27.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  这件事和朝比奈学姐没有关系"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 257, "start": "0:16:29.36", "end": "0:16:30.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那原因是什么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 258, "start": "0:16:31.30", "end": "0:16:32.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是凉宫同学吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 259, "start": "0:16:34.74", "end": "0:16:36.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然本人没有这个自觉"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 260, "start": "0:16:36.82", "end": "0:16:41.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是心里什么地方总在想着暑假不要结束吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 261, "start": "0:16:41.99", "end": "0:16:45.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那算啥啊  难道留着什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 262, "start": "0:16:45.56", "end": "0:16:47.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是这么想的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 263, "start": "0:16:47.56", "end": "0:16:52.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许她是想着暑假还有什么事情剩下没做吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 264, "start": "0:16:53.00", "end": "0:16:57.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还真是个\n会把一些莫名其妙的事情展开到大宇宙规模的家伙啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 265, "start": "0:16:57.80", "end": "0:16:59.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我该怎么办"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 266, "start": "0:17:00.03", "end": "0:17:02.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明白了这个的话  就能迎刃而解了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 267, "start": "0:17:03.99", "end": "0:17:07.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才我就觉得  你好像乐在其中呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 268, "start": "0:17:08.29", "end": "0:17:10.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知你是不是也这么想"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 269, "start": "0:17:10.56", "end": "0:17:15.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最近频繁发生的既视感之迷终于解开了嘛"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 270, "start": "0:17:16.11", "end": "0:17:22.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在想来  那只能理解为是由于记忆重置而散落下来的残渣吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 271, "start": "0:17:22.99", "end": "0:17:26.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  难道说全世界的人都感觉得到这个吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:26.55", "end": "0:17:30.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是这样  我和你算是特例了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 273, "start": "0:17:31.03", "end": "0:17:32.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那春日呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 274, "start": "0:17:32.79", "end": "0:17:35.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙多少有一点意识到吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 275, "start": "0:17:35.42", "end": "0:17:37.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点都没有呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 276, "start": "0:17:38.00", "end": "0:17:41.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒不如说有了反而糟糕了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 277, "start": "0:17:43.33", "end": "0:17:45.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  别说是既视感了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 278, "start": "0:17:45.75", "end": "0:17:51.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我觉得应该有一个人保存着所有轮回中的记忆"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 279, "start": "0:17:53.13", "end": "0:17:54.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁啊  那个人"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 280, "start": "0:17:55.38", "end": "0:17:56.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用说也该知道吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 281, "start": "0:17:58.80", "end": "0:17:59.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…是这样的吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 282, "start": "0:18:00.07", "end": "0:18:00.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 283, "start": "0:18:01.91", "end": "0:18:03.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "全都记得吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 284, "start": "0:18:03.51", "end": "0:18:04.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 285, "start": "0:18:04.87", "end": "0:18:08.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺带问下  这重复现在到底是第几次了？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 286, "start": "0:18:08.88", "end": "0:18:12.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次是第15527次"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 287, "start": "0:18:13.10", "end": "0:18:15.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15527？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 288, "start": "0:18:15.70", "end": "0:18:18.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15527是啥啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 289, "start": "0:18:18.65", "end": "0:18:20.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你在说啥啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 290, "start": "0:18:22.70", "end": "0:18:24.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那话是认真的吗…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 291, "start": "0:18:24.91", "end": "0:18:25.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 292, "start": "0:18:25.98", "end": "0:18:30.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么多的次数  我们全都在重复同样的事情吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 293, "start": "0:18:30.83", "end": "0:18:32.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并非全部如此"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 294, "start": "0:18:32.90", "end": "0:18:41.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "15527次中没有去盂兰盆会的模式  有第2391次和第11054次的这两次"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:41.67", "end": "0:18:46.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  去了盂兰盆会而没有捞金鱼的模式有437次"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 296, "start": "0:18:47.47", "end": "0:18:52.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去打工的有9052次  其内容有6个模式"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 297, "start": "0:18:52.76", "end": "0:18:57.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了发放气球  还有搬货物  做收银员  发送传单…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 298, "start": "0:19:00.31", "end": "0:19:01.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…已经够了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 299, "start": "0:19:06.29", "end": "0:19:07.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再见"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 300, "start": "0:19:11.48", "end": "0:19:13.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第15527次…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 301, "start": "0:19:14.36", "end": "0:19:15.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门她这么说了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 302, "start": "0:19:16.54", "end": "0:19:18.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乘上两周的话就是…唔…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 303, "start": "0:19:18.92", "end": "0:19:21.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多是595年的时间了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 304, "start": "0:19:22.67", "end": "0:19:28.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么长的时间仅她一个人能够好好地保留着记忆  无数次无数次地重复吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 305, "start": "0:19:30.30", "end": "0:19:35.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你到底到现在为止都是以什么样的心情度过的啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 306, "start": "0:19:38.22", "end": "0:19:40.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天是观测天体"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 307, "start": "0:19:41.18", "end": "0:19:42.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地点是长门的公寓"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 308, "start": "0:19:42.92", "end": "0:19:45.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "天体望远镜由古泉准备"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 309, "start": "0:19:47.07", "end": "0:19:48.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 310, "start": "0:19:49.29", "end": "0:19:50.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 311, "start": "0:19:50.24", "end": "0:19:50.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "火星人"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 312, "start": "0:19:51.52", "end": "0:19:53.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我倒不希望它存在啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 313, "start": "0:19:53.24", "end": "0:19:59.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "人类第一次踏上火星的时候  一定会从暗处跑出来欢迎吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 314, "start": "0:19:59.66", "end": "0:20:01.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「欢迎来到火星」什么的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 315, "start": "0:20:02.63", "end": "0:20:04.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我看够了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 316, "start": "0:20:04.65", "end": "0:20:06.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去找UFO吧  UFO"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 317, "start": "0:20:11.43", "end": "0:20:13.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙到底想做啥啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 318, "start": "0:20:14.19", "end": "0:20:15.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  是什么呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 319, "start": "0:20:16.74", "end": "0:20:19.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果知道的话  也能顺利解决了…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 320, "start": "0:20:21.65", "end": "0:20:23.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "试下这样怎么样"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 321, "start": "0:20:24.27", "end": "0:20:26.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从后面突然抱住凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 322, "start": "0:20:27.32", "end": "0:20:29.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她耳边轻语「I love you」"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 323, "start": "0:20:30.46", "end": "0:20:31.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这由谁来做啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 324, "start": "0:20:32.24", "end": "0:20:34.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了你没有适合的人呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 325, "start": "0:20:36.86", "end": "0:20:38.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "I…I love you…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 326, "start": "0:20:38.46", "end": "0:20:40.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…不要  我要摆脱这种支配"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 327, "start": "0:20:40.97", "end": "0:20:43.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我来做怎么样"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 328, "start": "0:20:45.65", "end": "0:20:49.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开玩笑的了  我做这角色还不够格"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 329, "start": "0:20:50.06", "end": "0:20:53.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样只会让凉宫同学增加无谓的混乱吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 330, "start": "0:20:56.93", "end": "0:21:00.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们之后去了打击中心"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:01.85", "end": "0:21:02.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  长门"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:03.35", "end": "0:21:07.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在朝比奈学姐说出来之前就注意到了这轮回吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 333, "start": "0:21:07.69", "end": "0:21:08.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:09.18", "end": "0:21:11.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那为什么沉默不语"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 335, "start": "0:21:13.29", "end": "0:21:15.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我的工作是观察"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 336, "start": "0:21:18.05", "end": "0:21:18.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 337, "start": "0:21:25.29", "end": "0:21:28.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怒涛般的暑假活动消化体制还在继续"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 338, "start": "0:21:28.50", "end": "0:21:33.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "烟花大会  钓虾虎鱼大会  试胆  电影连看后是海水浴"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 339, "start": "0:21:33.73", "end": "0:21:36.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们一直在活动来活动去的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 340, "start": "0:21:36.79", "end": "0:21:40.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然我觉得春日应该不会这样就满足"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 341, "start": "0:21:40.67", "end": "0:21:43.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但即便如此  也没有什么行动"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 342, "start": "0:21:44.05", "end": "0:21:47.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就这样终于来到了  八月三十日"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 343, "start": "0:21:48.49", "end": "0:21:51.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这样课题就如实地完成了呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 344, "start": "0:21:54.81", "end": "0:21:56.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样子好吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 345, "start": "0:21:59.02", "end": "0:22:01.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是…也就这样了呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 346, "start": "0:22:02.32", "end": "0:22:05.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  还有什么想做的吗"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 347, "start": "0:22:10.08", "end": "0:22:11.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  够了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 348, "start": "0:22:11.63", "end": "0:22:15.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个暑假已经做了好多事了  已经很充实了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 349, "start": "0:22:16.73", "end": "0:22:17.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不好！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 350, "start": "0:22:18.31", "end": "0:22:20.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你应该还没有满足才对"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 351, "start": "0:22:20.61", "end": "0:22:22.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 352, "start": "0:22:22.66", "end": "0:22:26.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 353, "start": "0:22:27.61", "end": "0:22:29.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天在社团教室再见吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 354, "start": "0:22:33.48", "end": "0:22:34.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等等啊  春…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 355, "start": "0:22:34.76", "end": "0:22:36.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 356, "start": "0:22:37.01", "end": "0:22:41.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天当预备日先空下来了  大家就这样休息吧"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 357, "start": "0:22:41.90", "end": "0:22:42.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又来了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 358, "start": "0:22:43.03", "end": "0:22:45.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且还前所未有地强烈！"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 359, "start": "0:22:45.90", "end": "0:22:47.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在不能让春日回去"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 360, "start": "0:22:47.87", "end": "0:22:48.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让她回去的话"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 361, "start": "0:22:49.26", "end": "0:22:54.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那重复了一万几千次的两星期又要陷入永远循环的窘境了"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 362, "start": "0:22:54.61", "end": "0:22:56.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  我该做什么呢"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 363, "start": "0:22:56.93", "end": "0:22:59.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在春日的话里应该有提示的"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 364, "start": "0:23:00.19", "end": "0:23:01.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但那是什么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 365, "start": "0:23:01.91", "end": "0:23:03.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她至今都说了些什么"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 366, "start": "0:23:04.14", "end": "0:23:07.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不明白  我想不起来…"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 367, "start": "0:23:13.84", "end": "0:23:15.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "八月三十一日"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 368, "start": "0:23:18.07", "end": "0:23:19.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "作业  还没动过"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 369, "start": "0:23:20.09", "end": "0:23:21.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "管他呢  怎么都成"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 370, "start": "0:23:22.32", "end": "0:23:28.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果再重复的话  作业做了也没意义啊"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 371, "start": "0:23:28.79", "end": "0:23:30.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管明天来不来"}
{"ep": "18", "idx": 372, "start": "0:23:31.22", "end": "0:23:34.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  也只能交给那时的我来处理了吧"}
